Algorithm - Freelancer Collaboration Hub (Console-Based)
1. Start the program.
2. Display the main menu.
3. Read the user's choice.
4. If Add Freelancer, read details and store.
5. If Add Client, read details and store.
6. If Create Project, read project details.
7. If Assign Project, assign freelancer to project.
8. If Update Status, modify project status.
9. If View/Search/Delete, perform requested operation.
10. Repeat until Exit is selected.
11. Stop the program.
